# Dot files and directories are not checked in. What a build genuinely needs is listed back in,
# and nothing else — so a local `.AGENTS.md` is ignored by the rule rather than by being named,
# and a tool that drops a new dot directory here cannot quietly add it to the repository.
.*
!.gitignore
!.gitkeep
# The shared code style and the commits `git blame` skips, both committed as the shared rules say.
!.editorconfig
!.git-blame-ignore-revs
!.github
# Java: the Maven wrapper's own directory, without which `./mvnw` picks a version nobody chose.
!.mvn
# Which part of the shared local Maven repository this agent installs into: one machine's fact.
.mvn/maven.config
# Flutter: written by `flutter create` and read by the tooling.
!.metadata

*.log
*.iml

# Flutter/Dart build output. Per-platform generated files get their own
# .gitignore from `flutter create`.
build/

# Packages are built, never committed.
build/packages/

# Maven
/target/

# Where a dependency is worked on beside this repository, as the guided walk is.
pubspec_overrides.yaml
